tmdb.org/t/p/original/mk5KbpRVls3imj1D23MjizLrRPs.jpg\",\"rating\":6.7,\"year\":2022,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Swiping. Dating. Ghosting. Have you wondered what was really going on in your date's head? \\\"Sex, Love, Misery\\\" reveals candid thoughts and encounters between diverse singles looking to mingle or marry, from initial texts to hook ups and beyond.\",\"genres\":[\"Documentary\",\"Comedy\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":358083,\"title\":\"The Paradise Suite\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/ZfRRNNfDdfeTYj8QD4EzIOCSi9.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/5gWhwqXKVXXtzFgxEmnQ7kAh0si.jpg\",\"rating\":6.4,\"year\":2015,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"The lives of six people, who seem to have nothing more in common than their faraway homelands, become inextricably linked in Amsterdam, the city they have chosen as their new home.\",\"genres\":[\"Drama\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":6967,\"title\":\"The White Masai\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/7hNAYqhwmVYtvxgSZFiKmWJDClP.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/jhPVZsEQYG4cLJ5IJV7J1n3bcQa.jpg\",\"rating\":6.3,\"year\":2005,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"A girl, Carola, whose vacation in Kenya takes an interesting turn when she becomes infatuated with a Masai. Carola decides to leave her boyfriend to stay with her lover. There, she has to adapt to the Masai's way of life and get used to their food which includes milk mixed with blood. She also has to face her husband's attitude towards women and what he expects from a wife. Nonetheless, Carola is welcomed warmly into the tribe she has chosen to join.\",\"genres\":[\"Drama\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":1151423,\"title\":\"I Am Not Big Bird\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/6P0Zj7BVMpimbDSHJl03ezATkqR.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/yBijB9vofBbxNIK0qGbtrqHnlNJ.jpg\",\"rating\":6.3,\"year\":2024,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Luis Carpio, a 30-something virgin who was dejected after his girlfriend turned down his marriage proposal, heads off on holiday to Thailand with a bunch of friends. Once there, a peculiar chain of events ensues when Luis is mistaken for a famous Thai porn star, the \\\"Big Bird\\\" of the title.\",\"genres\":[\"Comedy\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":61185,\"title\":\"Diary of a Sex Addict\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/oOkQLPTp6EyvTfQ5OTCUqeQ90pZ.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/d7ySmHdKkOOWvBOSxcLvLPnaoS0.jpg\",\"rating\":5.5,\"year\":2001,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"A restaurant owner leads a double life.\",\"genres\":[\"Drama\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":94219,\"title\":\"Love and Bruises\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/wFlcn2lTDj6RFJyfglxrwp12iti.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/sgVv6JlqYxf0mBjz5M2AlT6mm6N.jpg\",\"rating\":5.4,\"year\":2011,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Hua, a woman in her late twenties, goes against her family to become a teacher in Paris. She falls in love with men who physically abuse her. Will she ever find her true love?\",\"genres\":[\"Drama\",\"Romance\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":360232,\"title\":\"Entreturnos\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/r3u1T1KzxIRyC9j829YUaaIZ8H8.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/9oUDGSFbhHunmJZrly7owsQ7Rur.jpg\",\"rating\":4.7,\"year\":2014,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Beto is a bus conductor married to Gilda, who longs to have a child. When Beto gets closer to Leia, owner of his favorite bar, he meets Valcir, a newcomer who completes the love triangle that results in pregnancy. Amid the difficulties in dealing with this situation, the characters run through the city and find out more about themselves as they learn to confront their personal conflicts.\",\"genres\":[\"Drama\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":594304,\"title\":\"Cuck\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/jdTn8bDrghtLml0jgkagzlIXlWC.j